   "type": "text",
   "text": "### 446\n\n**Lease Rotation vs Both Full** Optimistic: both play full all night, check morning cases, adjust next night; loser’s work wastes. Rotation: agree 15-minute blocks by market clock; even blocks north leads, south thins to rhythm; odd blocks reverse. Lease expires alone — no peeking. If you pause, your number is stale, so rejoin quiet until next block. Choose Rotation to stop liveliness feedback loop. Example: 7:00 north solos melody, south taps chords; 7:15 swap, even if north case is fuller. Test: count coins per case per block for one night each system; Rotation wins if quiet-end takings rise and total stays level, not one case starved."
